    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 13.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðeofas we hateð oð VII men; from VII hloð oð XXXV; siððen bið here.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[A group of] up to seven men we call thieves; from seven to thirty-five a band; more is a troop.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">We use the term 'thieves' if the number of men does not exceed seven, 'band of marauders' for a number between seven and thirty-five. Anything beyond this is a 'raid.'</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Þeofas we hateð oð seofon men; from seofon monnum hloð oþ XXXV; siððen bið here.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
